터 교체가 매출 성장으로 즉각 전환된 사례는, 사바토 데 사르노 이후 구찌의 디렉터 교체 효과가 아직 뚜렷한 매출 반등으로 나타나지 않은 것과 대비되는 벤치마크다. 다만 비공식 집계치이며 지속성은 다음 공식 실적에서 확인이 필요하다.", "why_it_matters_en": "A creative-director transition that translated quickly into double-digit revenue growth remains a sharp contrast benchmark against Gucci's post-Sabato De Sarno transition, where a comparable rebound has not yet shown up. Caveat: figures are unofficial and durability is unconfirmed.", "relevance": "competitive threat"}, {"brand": "Hermès", "event_type": "shows", "headline": "에르메스 첫 오트쿠튀르 데뷔, 2027년 1월 확정 — 업계 최대 화제로 계속 회자", "summary": "Hermès' confirmed first-ever haute couture presentation, scheduled for Paris Haute Couture Week in January 2027 under womenswear artistic director Nadège Vanhée, continues to be cited across fashion press as the year's most consequential runway-calendar move, alongside Grace Wales Bonner's own January 2027 menswear debut.", "url": "https://www.businessoffashion.com/news/fashion-week/hermes-to-stage-first-couture-show-in-january/", "source": "Business of Fashion", "tier": "T1", "published_at": "2026-08-14", "why_it_matters": "완성형 하우스인 에르메스조차 쿠튀르로 위계를 확장하는 것은 럭셔리 최상위 서사 경쟁이 격화되고 있음을 보여주며, 구찌가 쿠튀르·아틀리에 수준 스토리텔링을 검토할 유인이 된다.", "why_it_matters_en": "Even the industry's most disciplined house extending into couture signals intensifying competition at the top of the prestige hierarchy — a prompt for Gucci to weigh its own couture/atelier-level storytelling ambitions.", "relevance": "benchmark opportunity"}, {"brand": "Hermès", "event_type": "legal", "headline": "에르메스 상속인 대 LVMH 아르노 소송, 60억 유로대 지분 분쟁 지속", "summary": "The long-running civil lawsuit by Hermès heir Nicolas Puech against LVMH chairman Bernard Arnault, alleging he was improperly stripped of roughly 6 million Hermès shares worth about $16.3 billion, remains unresolved in Paris civil courts; a prior Geneva appellate ruling rejected Puech's claims against his former wealth advisor, and LVMH continues to deny wrongdoing.", "url": "htt